<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-28T05:59:35.563Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 05:59:35 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Afghan Taliban mortar fire on the northwest Pakistan border killed one civilian and wounded five, and separate Afghan firing near Angoor Adda injured five people. Pakistan responded with strikes on Taliban positions and destroyed border check posts, and launched an operation against illegal Afghans in Peshawar starting Nov 1. The Pakistani minister linked the border closure to a rise in LPG prices. The conflict recorded 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/27/qatar-urges-iran-to-show-goodwill-by-ending-threats-to-the-region-and-reopening-the-strait&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE9zbXNScF9zellYQ3RwN0w1eGlGQWVQSmFNWjViX1MxaVkzMGwzelpERVhaNWU3aFJzNFZkTks5d05jYVJJMzNVQw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPLTZVcnFYOUktR29oQVBLNXBndXY5Q0c4VEFxUHp1ekphWml6YmY0QVpUSktnaThYUHhzVXJUc09QdDh5cFpyaDMtZzl0R0Eyd3JlS2RxY252V1J3Zm5IMmFRLUktdEFtd1J3ZnF5M1FERXk0ZW5sUDFpdkdzUVhLWTlCbzNkOVRTRzBJUWwxNUhTeXlxR0tKdEFHMXlkajBGcjkyMUZHOWlSNXBienlJT1BNVE8zamJSRWxmb0ln?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE12MVB0RV9NY0RzbW4wTVBDd2xoRGNENmk3a1I2M0NDX1ZNX3BadUhhOFlLckdFNk95RjJ6ZEZKeldiQ0lMRUxjdg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1DaFg2M0tJdTVMMm9CRkZBX3BBWlBveFFCMkg1LTBhT2czZ3pzOHAwQjhEN3FtcEVEeW9jTmF2Uy0zMU5MeUhjNw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
